{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>STORY</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before <strong>Nolan Mercer</strong>. Before the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Someone else got in. Someone who was never supposed to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More Than Just Walking</strong> \u2013 Navigate environmental challenges, interact with the world, and uncover hidden mechanics that go beyond simple exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Psychological Horror with Depth</strong> \u2013 Tension builds through atmosphere, sound, and unsettling encounters, avoiding reliance on simple jump scares.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An Unpredictable Journey</strong> \u2013 No clear path, no certainty\u2014just the overwhelming feeling that something is terribly wrong.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <i>Facility of Dusk: Prologue</i>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3651400?t=1750375351","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3651400?t=1750375351","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651400/359ed6911f7e5ca440e4242efd6d2fb259260a7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750375351","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651400/359ed6911f7e5ca440e4242efd6d2fb259260a7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750375351","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>STORY</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before <strong>Nolan Mercer</strong>. Before the mission.</p><p clas